ction, eye pressure, and an examination of the front and back of the eye. Results are used to provide an up-to-date prescription for glasses or contact lenses."}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"From £25"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"20-25 minutes"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4 text-center","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gray-100","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-4 h-4 text-gray-400","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}]}]}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"Comprehensive Eye Test"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"A more in-depth eye examination that includes additional diagnostic checks beyond the standard test. This may include digital retinal imaging, extended health screening, and a more detailed discussion of your visual needs. Recommended for patients who want a thorough assessment or who have a family history of eye conditions."}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"From £50"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"30-35 minutes"}